{
    "background_story": "Sarai was a free-spirited artist who had always felt confined by the conventions of her small town. Growing up, she was expected to follow a traditional path, but her creative energy was waiting to be uncoiled. After completing her art degree, Sarai traveled the world, immersing herself in different cultures and art forms. She discovered a passion for sculpture and began creating intricate, coil-based pieces that reflected her newfound sense of freedom. As her art gained recognition, Sarai's confidence grew, and she started to uncoil her true self. She let go of the expectations of others and allowed her creativity to flourish. Now, her studio is a haven for self-expression, where she weaves together disparate elements to create stunning works of art that reflect her unbridled spirit.",
